        "text": "Security update for ovmf",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for ovmf fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2023-45229: integer underflow and out-of-bounds read when processing IA_NA/IA_TA options in a DHCPv6 Advertise\n  message (bsc#1218879).\n- CVE-2023-45230: out-of-bounds write in the DHCPv6 client through a long Server ID option (bsc#1218880).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
